# pocket-agent-api (`apps/api`)

Hono Cloudflare Worker — **Google OAuth ID token** verification (no Supabase).

- `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` must match the web/desktop Google Cloud app.
- Public: `GET /health`
- Protected (Bearer Google JWT): `GET /auth`, `GET /me`
- Register new routes in `src/index.ts` inside the `secured` sub-app.
- Use `successResponse` / `errorResponse` from `src/utils/response.ts`.

Pairing: [pocket-agent-web-app](https://github.com/pocket-agent/pocket-agent-web-app) — `VITE_API_BASE_URL` → this worker; `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` → frontend origin.

Docs: [../../docs/API_STACK.md](../../docs/API_STACK.md)
